    <li><b>ISO/IEC 30134-2 (PUE)</b>, <b>30134-9 (WUE)</b> — energy / water efficiency reporting.</li>
    <li><b>EnergyTag T-EAC</b> hourly matching — basis for §4.4 24/7 CFE result.</li>
    <li><b>UK DNO Statement of Works + ENA EREC G99 Issue 2</b> — connection compliance.</li>
    <li><b>NESO SQSS Schedule 4</b> — dual-supply requirement at hyperscale loads (basis for §3.3).</li>
    <li><b>CCCM v19</b> + <b>NGET RIIO-T3 Final Determinations</b> Dec 2025 — connection cost split (§3.4).</li>
    <li><b>NPS EN-1 / EN-3 (May 2026 pending)</b> — NSIP screening (§5.2).</li>
    <li><b>UKCP18 RCP4.5</b> — climate-projection PUE drift (§4.3).</li>
  </ul>
</section>


